  "body": "### Benchmark\n\nFPS Benchmark\n\n| Test            | Avg FPS | Min FPS | Max FPS |\n|-----------------|---------|---------|---------|\n| FPS Modpack     | 1053    | 708     | 1593    |\n| Minecraft Vanilla | 411     | 320     | 569     |\n\n### System Setup\n\nHere’s the system setup I used for this benchmark:\n\n| Component        | Specification                     |\n|------------------|-----------------------------------|\n| **OS**           | Microsoft Windows 11 Pro 24H2     |\n| **Motherboard**  | Z370P D3-CF                       |\n| **CPU**          | Intel Core i7-9700K               |\n| **GPU**          | NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 3GB       |\n| **RAM**          | 32 GB                             |\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. **Download** the [Modrinth App](https://modrinth.com/app).\n2. **Install** the FPS Modpack via \"Browse\" in the app.\n3. **Play** and enjoy optimized performance.\n\nMore info in the [**Modrinth Modpack Guide**](https://support.modrinth.com/en/articles/8802250-modpacks-on-modrinth).\n\n## Resources & Downloads\n- [**Download Now**](https://modrinth.com/modpack/fps/version/latest)\n- [_Modrinth App_](https://modrinth.com/app)\n- [_Prism Launcher_](https://prismlauncher.org)",
